# The Spec Chat commit the kit's tests run (tests/accepted.sh, tests/review-host.sh; #96).
# Never the box's ~/src/spec-chat clone: its HEAD differs per box and CI has none.
# `just vendored-fetch` caches it; `scripts/check-vendored --spec-chat DEST` writes it out offline.
# To move it: change the sha, `just vendored-fetch`, `just check`.
